          "id": "prose",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 120.625,
          "width": 320,
          "height": 650.9375,
          "bottom": 771.5625,
          "fontSize": "21px",
          "lineHeight": "32.55px",
          "tracking": "normal",
          "maxWidth": "100%",
          "overflowWrap": "anywhere",
          "clientWidth": 320,
          "scrollWidth": 320,
          "lines": [
            "A page begins to speak before we",
            "read its first sentence. The width",
            "of a column, the space between",
            "lines, and the quiet around a",
            "heading tell us how to approach",
            "it. Those relationships change",
            "with the words, the typeface, and",
            "the screen. A useful tool should",
            "make that change visible while",
            "leaving room for judgment.",
            "Consider a heading enlarged by a",
            "few points. It may cross a",
            "wrapping threshold, add a line,",
            "and pull the paragraph below it",
            "down the page. The right",
            "response may involve a wider",
            "measure, a smaller gap, or simply",
            "accepting the new rhythm. No",
            "single ratio can settle that choice."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
